+-### Option 1: Install as Plugin (Recommended)
+-
+-The easiest way to use this repo - install as a Claude Code plugin:
+-
+-```bash
+-# Add this repo as a marketplace
+-/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code
+-
